  <noscript><main class="page"><h1>A little space for big ideas.</h1><p>Enable JavaScript to open your local reading library. You can still read the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}format/`}>book format guide</a>.</p></main></noscript>
</Layout>
